    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you gain Tremorsense with a range of 60 feet for 10 minutes. You must be on a stone surface or touching a stone surface to use this Tremorsense. The stone can be natural or worked. You can use this Bonus Action a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-7BtT80083mC3Eavg\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes the limited uses and an Active Effect that grants you the 60 feet of Tremorsense. It does not automatically update your Token's vision settings.</p></section>",
